{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where text extends over more than one line, horizontal alignment and justify values can be different."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The most typical case is for credits, such as:"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"halign","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLeftCenterRight","text":"MXLLeftCenterRight","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLLeftCenterRightO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Words and music by Pat Songwriter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Typically this type of credit is aligned to the right, so that the position information refers to the right-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most part of the text. But in this example, the text is center-justified, not right-justified."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The halign attribute is used in these situations. If it is not present, its value is the same as for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"justify attribute. For elements where a justify attribute is not allowed, the default is implementation-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dependent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"halign"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLAccordionRegistration\/halign"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","d